---
// A section's top divider: a hairline that brightens toward the centre and
// fades to nothing at both edges. Full-bleed, so the bright point sits at the
// centre of the viewport. Colour rides the theme's rule token.
---

<div
  class="pointer-events-none h-px w-full [background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--color-rule-2)_50%,transparent)]"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
</div>
